sequenceDiagram
 participant S as Sales/Purchase client
 participant O as Order service
 participant I as Inventory service
 participant A as Accounting service
 S->>O: Create/confirm order
 O->>O: Validate state and permissions
 O->>I: Create/advance fulfillment demand
 I-->>O: Stock/receipt result
 O->>A: Create accounting document when enabled by source flow
 A-->>O: Accounting result
 O-->>S: Final state or explicit failure
